  "content": "<div>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span>江戶時代日本城鎮 - 江戶城</span></strong></em></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>一座以江戶時代為背景的日本城鎮，結構完整、裝飾精美，擁有一座大型華麗城堡及多種周邊建築。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>地形從零開始重塑，並經過策略性佈局，以促進最佳遊戲體驗。</span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span>地圖</span></strong></em></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>以下為從創造模式觀看整個地圖（包含所有建築）的圖片。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3dfb01f4-4a77-4e1b-b6cc-17935e862f50.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_96b8795e-4391-42e9-a3af-547b45c62313.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e1cc81e3-36ba-4ee8-bc1f-77c3364c4a7f.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_57afab8d-350f-44bf-95f2-292efe602c10.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c48c7b62-6c71-453a-b8c7-0520301b203f.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a5f7df64-b17a-446c-a2ff-55b850adbada.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_da69c23a-f67f-4f44-81b7-3840b051f584.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1f56309b-aea9-49d0-a47a-d768d8bdd408.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_899243b7-3dfa-4826-92e6-667d4d2c2e65.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span>更新</span></strong></em></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>更新將在當前項目完成後進行。</span></p>\n</div>",
